# Secrets -- none of these may ever be committed or deployed.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
id_rsa*

# Android signing. Losing this file means never being able to update the
# Play Store listing; publishing it means somebody else can sign an app as
# you. It belongs in neither git nor /var/www.
*.keystore
*key-info*
*.aab
Dhundo - Google Play package/
Dhundo - Google Play package.zip

# This one is per-deployment and is restored from the server, not the repo.
src/config.js

# The public download copy is deliberately NOT ignored -- it has to ship:
#   public/dhundo.apk
# Everything else Android-signing-related above still is.
